  "bodyHash": "b57948bebb048d08",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>沉浸式小地圖</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-overlays%252fversions%253fl%253dfabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinytra/.github/refs/heads/main/badges/connector/cozy.svg\" alt=\"相容於 Sinytra Connector\"></a></p>\n<p>一款極簡風格的客戶端小地圖模組，將 Hoofprint 整合至玩家介面中，僅在玩家持有地圖時才會顯示。</p>\n<p>本模組可與我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-overlays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Overlays</a> 模組搭配使用，於 HUD 中顯示更多資訊。</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>只要玩家的背包（含束口袋）中有地圖，就會顯示周遭環境的小地圖覆蓋層。</p>\n<h2>安裝方式</h2>\n<p>沉浸式小地圖為客戶端模組。其依賴項目如下：</p>\n<h3>依賴項目</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>需要安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhoofprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hoofprint</a>。</li>\n<li>1.2.3 及以上版本需安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmru\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MRU</a>。</li>\n<li>於 Fabric 環境下需安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</li>\n<li>於 NeoForge 環境下需安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconnector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flaunchpad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Launchpad</a>。</li>\n<li>建議安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmcqoy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">McQoy</a> 以進行模組設定。</li>\n<li>建議安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-overlays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Overlays</a> 以獲得額外的模組相容性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>常見問題</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本模組是否會移植至其他版本/載入器？<ul>\n<li>沉浸式小地圖已支援 Surveyor 1.0.0 發布的所有版本（1.20.1、1.21.1、1.21.8 及 26.1）。本模組與 Hoofprint 目前均未原生支援 NeoForge，但均可透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> 使用。</li></ul></li>\n<li>模組相容性？<ul>\n<li>為方便維護，核心模組僅支援 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftrinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftrinkets-updated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(已更新)</a>。若需支援模組背包或其他配件模組，請額外安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-overlays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Overlays</a>，本模組將調用其龐大的模組相容性程式碼。</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>疑難排解 / 建議</h3>\n<p>沉浸式小地圖是 Hoofprint 的擴充模組，基於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsurveyor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Surveyor 地圖框架</a> 開發。本模組負責渲染由 Surveyor 與 Hoofprint 收集的資料。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>關於小地圖的問題與建議請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/cassiancc/immersive-minimaps/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Minimaps Issues</a></li>\n<li>關於地圖分享、已探索區域及自動標記的問題與建議請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/sisby-folk/surveyor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Surveyor Issues</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<p>本模組在 <a href=\"https://github.com/HestiMae/hoofprint/blob/26.1/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL 授權條款</a> 下，重用了部分 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhoofprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hoofprint</a> 的程式碼。</p>\n<p>模組圖示由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fnoelledotjpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nöelle</a> 設計。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252ffUFr3Mvj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Surveyor 生態系</a> 致力於降低地圖製作門檻！（且為開源專案）歡迎您為 <a href=\"https://github.com/cassiancc/Immersive-Overlays/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Minimaps</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/HestiMae/hoofprint/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hoofprint</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/sisby-folk/surveyor/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Surveyor</a> 貢獻改進意見，或將 Surveyor 應用於您自己的模組中！</p>",
